      "value": "There is already a component you can use to disable the keyboard for what ever input field it's added to (search Keyboard in the components menu). Unsure if it's exposed to Udon, but that should be something that wouldn't be to difficult for them to implement :)\nSo there will be a sort of grace period before these things are *sorted* out in worlds. Though, getting a way to toggle it in Udon would be ideal, as it could be a world setting too.",
