  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not sure how to find the current build ID so I apologize for lacking that. \nThe copy and paste function in the live beta has been leaving a link in whichever box you paste, which for some worlds has been fine, but in worlds where there isn't a load button to press on video players it will immediately load up the video, which can sometimes cause you to be rate limited or create an issue trying to post another link in afterwards, which always causes a rate limit issue. \nAlternatively, an option to disable the in-game keyboard for URL inserts would be helpful for players who already have something like XSOverlay or OVR Toolkit for typing in VR, since every time a friend or myself clicks on a URL box to paste something in we can't just paste it normally anymore.",
